@startuml Manager AI Scheduling Sequence
title Sequence Diagram: Đề xuất & Áp dụng lịch chiếu AI (Manager)
skinparam theme cerulean

actor Manager
boundary "manage-scheduling.html" as UI
control "SchedulingController" as Ctrl
entity "SchedulingService" as Svc
entity "GeneticAlgorithm" as GA
database "MySQL" as DB

Manager -> UI: Nhập tham số (Start Date, End Date, Room Types)
UI -> Ctrl: POST /api/scheduling/ai-suggest (SchedulingRequest)
activate Ctrl

Ctrl -> Svc: generateAISuggestions(request)
activate Svc

Svc -> DB: findActiveMovies()
Svc -> DB: findRooms()

loop Mỗi Phòng & Ngày
    Svc -> GA: optimizeShowtime(movies, room, date)
    activate GA
    GA --> Svc: optimalShowtimeList
    deactivate GA
end

Svc --> Ctrl: List<ShowtimeResponse> (Suggestions)
deactivate Svc

Ctrl --> UI: 200 OK (Danh sách đề xuất)
deactivate Ctrl

Manager -> UI: Duyệt hoặc Chỉnh sửa đề xuất
Manager -> UI: Click "Apply Suggestions"

UI -> Ctrl: POST /api/scheduling/apply-suggestions (ApplyRequest)
activate Ctrl

Ctrl -> Svc: applySuggestions(suggestions, overwrite)
activate Svc

Svc -> DB: saveAll(showtimes)
Svc --> Ctrl: void
deactivate Svc

Ctrl --> UI: 200 OK
deactivate Ctrl

UI -> Manager: Hiển thị hoàn tất & Cập nhật UI
@enduml
